WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:03.097
"What's happening now?" Roxy asked.

2
00:00:03.098 --> 00:00:08.218
All the cubes moved down, bringing them below the stadium.

3
00:00:08.219 --> 00:00:12.051
They came to rest in a large room with lots of furniture.

4
00:00:12.052 --> 00:00:14.969
The Battle Master's voice came over a loudspeaker.

5
00:00:14.970 --> 00:00:20.184
"This is a rest period. You are free to move around."

6
00:00:20.185 --> 00:00:22.107
The cubes disappeared.

7
00:00:22.108 --> 00:00:27.208
Cozlin ran over to Roxy. "Finally! We can walk around!"

8
00:00:27.209 --> 00:00:31.035
"Nice work, Rocket Girl," Wukong said.

9
00:00:31.036 --> 00:00:34.080
"I would have smashed Surina with my iron bar.

10
00:00:34.081 --> 00:00:37.224
But freezing her was a pretty good idea too."

11
00:00:37.225 --> 00:00:41.864
Roxy sighed. "I wish I didn't have to fight at all."

12
00:00:41.865 --> 00:00:47.471
Cozlin nodded. "But if we don't fight, we'll be stuck here forever."

13
00:00:47.472 --> 00:00:51.839
She looked around at the other fighters. Suddenly she gasped.

14
00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:55.583
"What's wrong?" Roxy looked over and gasped too.

15
00:00:55.584 --> 00:00:57.829
The dragon was curled up across the room.

16
00:00:57.830 --> 00:01:01.644
Wukong laughed. "Don't worry.

17
00:01:01.645 --> 00:01:05.237
The dragon isn't angry now. And it's not evil."

18
00:01:05.238 --> 00:01:08.793
Cozlin raised an eyebrow. "How do you know?"

19
00:01:08.794 --> 00:01:11.827
"That dragon is a spirit," Wukong said.

20
00:01:11.828 --> 00:01:16.637
"Just like I am. Follow me!" He walked over to the dragon.

21
00:01:16.638 --> 00:01:18.799
Roxy and Cozlin looked at each other.

22
00:01:18.800 --> 00:01:22.801
They shrugged and then followed the monkey.

23
00:01:22.802 --> 00:01:26.747
"Hi! I'm Sun Wukong, king of the Fruit and Flower Mountain."

24
00:01:26.748 --> 00:01:28.285
The dragon looked at him.

25
00:01:28.286 --> 00:01:32.679
"Are you the Sun Wukong who tried to take over Heaven?"

26
00:01:32.680 --> 00:01:37.183
Wukong grinned. "Yep! I got in big trouble for that."

27
00:01:37.184 --> 00:01:41.762
The dragon stood up. "My name is Sapphire."

28
00:01:41.763 --> 00:01:46.087
Cozlin frowned. "Why did you attack my city?"

29
00:01:46.088 --> 00:01:51.397
Sapphire narrowed her eyes. "You stole the sacred gold."

30
00:01:51.398 --> 00:01:55.474
Roxy scratched her head. "Sacred gold?"

31
00:01:55.475 --> 00:02:02.210
"Yes," Sapphire said. "Long ago a land was rocked by earthquakes. Buddha

32
