placed sacred gold under the land. The

33
00:02:05.843 --> 00:02:09.281
gold brought balance to the land." Cozlin

34
00:02:09.282 --> 00:02:13.470
bit her lip. "Oops. Sorry." "Hmph."

35
00:02:13.471 --> 00:02:16.099
Sapphire gave her a dirty look. "Buddha

36
00:02:16.100 --> 00:02:22.666
knew that thieves might try to steal the gold. He told me to guard it." "You

37
00:02:22.667 --> 00:02:29.173
were stuck underground for all those years?" Roxy asked. "That's awful." Sapphire

38
00:02:29.174 --> 00:02:33.001
smiled. "No, it was an honor. I

39
00:02:33.002 --> 00:02:37.321
was being punished for eating one of the Jade Emperor's horses. Buddha

40
00:02:37.322 --> 00:02:41.639
said I could earn forgiveness if I guarded the gold." Wukong's

41
00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:43.452
eyes lit up. "I'm

42
00:02:43.453 --> 00:02:46.308
trying to earn forgiveness too. I'm

43
00:02:46.309 --> 00:02:49.976
helping the Tang Monk reach the Western Paradise." "Wait

44
00:02:49.977 --> 00:02:52.418
a second," Roxy said suddenly. "You

45
00:02:52.419 --> 00:02:57.214
mentioned earthquakes . . . What will happen if the gold isn't returned?" "The

46
00:02:57.215 --> 00:03:01.048
earthquakes will start again," Sapphire said. "Perhaps

47
00:03:01.049 --> 00:03:05.628
they already have. They will grow in strength. Each

48
00:03:05.629 --> 00:03:08.739
