51
00:03:19.332 --> 00:03:22.476
"Take the next exit," Terrell said.

52
00:03:22.477 --> 00:03:25.961
He and Roxy's mom were driving toward the mountains.

53
00:03:25.962 --> 00:03:29.844
"I hope Dr. Odd can help us," Roxy's mom said.

54
00:03:29.845 --> 00:03:33.909
Rumble! Rumble! The earth shook again.

55
00:03:33.910 --> 00:03:38.009
Up ahead, the road buckled as a huge crack formed across it.

56
00:03:38.010 --> 00:03:41.913
"Oh no!" Roxy's mom slammed on the brakes.

57
00:03:41.914 --> 00:03:45.842
The car skidded. It stopped just as they reached the crack.

58
00:03:45.843 --> 00:03:49.159
The front wheels went over, but the rest of the car didn't.

59
00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:52.594
"Whew!" Terrell said. "That was—"

60
00:03:52.595 --> 00:03:55.912
Rumble! The earth shook again.

61
00:03:55.913 --> 00:04:01.945
The crack grew wider, and the car slid into the darkness!

